She gave a quarter of her sheep to her sister, which means she was left with (1 - 1/4) times her initial number of sheep, which is 3/4x.

She then gave half of the remaining sheep to her brother, which means she was left with (1 - 1/2) times the number of sheep she had after giving to her sister, which is 1/2 times 3/4
